entityDescription:
ASF Metrology (born in 2006) is an ISO 9001: 2015 certified company that sells new, used and retrofitted three-dimensional measuring machines / CMMs.
With the recent acquisition of the CMM business, ASF Metrology has succeeded in consolidating its business and its competitiveness, offering today a new range of high quality CMMs with excellent ceramic construction and multi-sensor software.

With its precision, multi-function options and available customizations, ALTERA is the most configurable CMM, available for quality control in the metrology room, process control and assembly line.

The company unites a group of technicians with many years of experience in the field of measuring machines, offering metrology services such as:

Metrological Consulting;
Repair, ordinary / extraordinary maintenance and retrofit on all types of measuring machines;
Maintenance contracts and personalized services;
Certifications and performance checks (according to UNI ISO 10360/2 standards);
Moving and re-installation of measuring machines;
Supply of spare parts and accessories for measurement: probes, modular clamping systems etc. ;
Measurements for third parties, in the ASF Metrology laboratories or at the customer's facilities;
Reverse engineering of objects (even large ones) with surface reconstruction;
Courses of use and updating of the most common measurement software;
Special applications, software customizations and programming.
ASF Metrology also has:

X-ray Computed Tomography Systems (Industrial CTs)
Universal Tracers (TU) for testing and Design, especially appreciated in the world of the Automobile
Portable Anthropomorphic Arms, of Laser Scanner Sensors for Measurement and Reverse Engineering
2D optical machines
Software solutions for measurement on machine tools, three-dimensional machines and for reverse engineering
Portal for the online statistical management of measurements made on Coordinate Measuring Machines, fixed gauges or instruments.

